    "sentences": [
      "This month, Kaya sat at her PC with a travel plan.",
      "She wanted to visit a new country around the Mediterranean city.",
      "She hoped to see an olive tree.",
      "She looked for old anime comic books to sell.",
      "Kaya did not forget her dream: a plane trip.",
      "She heard about a famous musical from that culture.",
      "It told of a battle, a court, and an old rule.",
      "She would carry a camera and volunteer to help.",
      "Kaya drank her barley tea, not coffee.",
      "She did not worry about the long flight.",
      "There was much laughter as she began to tell her mom.",
      "Finally, she did not want to lose her dream."
